From 60982a9da8e52fda759a534c8040bd142ac01541 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nathan Singh <nathan.singh@hotmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 16:40:05 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Arena: a second tournament, the Boss Rush, with a tournament
 flag and no healing

A series is now one of two tournaments, chosen at the attendant's tournament menu
(a second icon and label) and kept in a persistent byte flag, FLAG_ARENA_TOURNAMENT
(0x7f8: unreferenced and not computed from anywhere), so a save remembers it.

- The Boss Rush is six rounds of bosses (Orc Lord and Lizard King up to the Fusion
  Dragon alone); the Gauntlet stays at twelve. The round count is per tournament
  (ARENA_ROUNDS), the ladder is per tournament (arena_ladder.c), and the give-up
  question, the round report and the cleared line each have a message for it.
- Healing is a tournament setting (ARENA_HEALS). The Boss Rush does not heal the
  party after a win or when the manager is left during a series; the Gauntlet
  does. After a loss, or between series, the party is restored as before.

Three consecutive messages for each tournament (give up, next round, cleared) are
found as the first's id plus 3 times the tournament; the tournament labels are the
consecutive pair MsgArenaTournamentGauntlet and MsgArenaTournamentBossRush.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
